// Typecheck-only config for the test suite.
//
// The build config emits `src` into `dist` with `rootDir: src`, so it cannot also
// include `tests` — which meant the loader's tests were compiled only by vitest's
// esbuild transform. esbuild strips types without checking them, so a test file
// could reference a type that no longer exists and every one of `build`, `test`
// and `lint` would still pass.
//
// That is not hypothetical: #18 widened `ModApi` from a 2-member stub to the full
// published `TspmlApi`, and the stale object literal in loader.test.ts would have
// stayed green. Wired into `lint` so CI runs it.
{
  "extends": "../../tsconfig.base.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "noEmit": true
  },
  "include": ["src", "tests"]
}
